# Spanish (neutral Latin American) translation for Mellowtone.
#
# MACHINE DRAFT: pending native review. Wording is short, "tu" form.
#
# Glossary (keep consistent; extend when adding strings):
#   Queue = Cola                    Playlist = Lista (de reproduccion)
#   Library = Biblioteca            Settings = Ajustes
#   Favorites = Favoritos           Most Played = Mas reproducidas
#   Shuffle = Aleatorio             Repeat = Repetir
#   Gapless = Gapless (English)     Crossfade = Crossfade (English)
#   Equalizer = Ecualizador (EQ)    Plugin = Plugin (Plugin Store = Tienda de plugins)
#   Cover / album art = Caratula    Metadata = Metadatos
#   SD card = Tarjeta SD            Firmware Update = Actualizar firmware
#   On / Off = Activado / Desactivado
#   Kept in English as product or technical names: Bluetooth, Wi-Fi, AirPlay,
#   DLNA, Subsonic, ReplayGain, DAC, USB, ADB, LDAC, aptX, AAC, SBC, PEQ, PIN.
#   Time zone city names, release labels and codec names are not
#   translated.
# (Accents are used in the actual msgstr values below; this comment block is
#  ASCII only.)
#
